/* Canonical semantic transaction catalog.
 *
 * TX_TYPE(id, family, availability, transaction_role, chain_encoding,
 *         privacy, lifecycle, builder_command, commit_command,
 *         inspect_command, component_commands_csv, network_policy,
 *         lab_case_id, proof_level, test_group, summary)
 *
 * Keep ids aligned with tools/dev/transaction_lab_catalog.def where a lab
 * case exists.  Empty commands mean there is deliberately no native builder.
 */

